  "implemented_scope": "Explicit finite interpretation/clarification with immutable answer history; strict raw-source and typed-domain-candidate inspection; source/request-bound finite review sessions, saved instance references, explicit proposal adoption and prior-version isolation. Offline revision-context/0.1 remains available. Execution-revision-envelope/0.1 and revision-context/0.2 separately preserve original source and verified question/action evidence; typed-domain-revision/0.1 inspection validates the new finite syntax and exact evidence. Saved revision proposals pin actual method instructions for stable replay. Bounded real language calls and local persistence are composed by apps; this package has no transport, persistence, automatic semantic acceptance or fidelity proof.",
